# Phone CLI — No Shortcuts

Clippy denies unwrap/todo/panic **including tests**.

- NEVER `.unwrap()` / `.expect()` / `panic!` in tests — ALWAYS `Result` + `?`.
- NEVER pretend ADB/Tailscale/WebRTC succeeded when the runner failed — ALWAYS typed errors.
- NEVER put ADB logic in zsh — ALWAYS keep `phone.zsh` as install+exec only.
- NEVER call `std::process::Command` from harden/wan tables — ALWAYS inject `CommandRunner`.
